  "body": "The section [Link type \"preload\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-preload) contains a link ref to [[PRELOAD]](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/references.html#refsPRELOAD), which itself links back to [Link type \"preload\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-preload) since W3C Preload has been merged in HTML.  \r\n\r\nThe situation is slightly complicated by the fact the #ref does acknowledge the work done by I. Grigorik on this spec.\r\n\r\ncc @noamr @annevk ",
